    "html": "<p>Two blocks of the same cross-sectional area are joined as shown on the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>The left end of the first block is held at a constant temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"800\\: \\textup{K}\"></span> and the right end of the second block is held at a constant temperature of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>. The temperature at the point where the blocks are joined is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"500\\: \\textup{K}\"></span>. The first block has a length of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2L\"></span> and a conductivity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5k\"></span>. The second block has a length of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> and a conductivity of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3k\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\\,?\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"150\\: \\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"250\\: \\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"300\\: \\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\\: \\textup{K}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
